    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Check the three clues",
        "body": "Remember: the bear's right side is on **our left** when it faces us.\n\n- Triangle on the belly: only (B), (D) and (E).\n- Right eye covered: the ear must cover the eye on our left. In (B) the ear covers the eye on our right, so (B) is out.\n- Left hand raised: the raised arm must be on our right. In (E) the raised arm is on our left, so (E) is out.\n\n(D) fits all three clues.\n\n**Answer: (D)**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Start with the hand",
        "body": "The bear's left hand is on our right. Bears with the arm on our right raised and a triangle on the belly: only (D), whose ear covers the eye on our left — its right eye.\n\n**Answer: (D)**"
      }
