        "title": "Beads and shape",
        "body": "Sophie's necklace is a closed ring with 4 beads. From one of these beads a short string hangs, with 1 more bead at its end: 5 beads in total.\n\n- (A) and (C) have no hanging string.\n- (D) has two loose strings.\n- (E) has 7 beads.\n- (B) is a ring with 4 beads, and from the right bead a string goes inside the ring to 1 more bead. ✓\n\nA necklace can be moved around, so the hanging string may lie inside the ring.\n\n**Answer: (B)**"
