        "title": "Count beads first",
        "body": "Sophie's necklace has 5 beads. (A) has 4, (C) has 6 and (E) has 7, so they are out. (D) has 5 beads but two loose ends, while Sophie's necklace has only one loose end. That leaves (B).\n\n**Answer: (B)**"
