        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": ""
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Step by step",
        "body": "- 4 apples, 5 bananas: 3 apples → 1 banana. Now 1 apple, 6 bananas.\n- 6 bananas → 2 apples. Now 3 apples, 0 bananas.\n- 3 apples → 1 banana. Now 0 apples, 1 banana.\n\nNothing more can be changed.\n\n**Answer: (A)** one banana"
      },
      {
        "title": "Other order",
        "body": "Bananas first: 3 bananas → 1 apple: 5 apples, 2 bananas. 3 apples → 1 banana: 2 apples, 3 bananas. 3 bananas → 1 apple: 3 apples. 3 apples → 1 banana. Again 1 banana.\n\n**Answer: (A)**"
      }
